  "description": "⭐<em>Don't just watch the film. </em><strong><em>Taste it.</em></strong><br>\r\n<em>A bespoke cinematic dining experience where iconic film moments come straight to your table as they appear on screen,&nbsp;course by delicious course.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!<br>\r\n💍 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film The Lord of The Rings: The Fellowship of The Ring (2001)<br>\r\n🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments<br>\r\n🥔 Expect a birthday surprise, foraged favourites, obligatory potato references and much more!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date: September &amp; October 2026<br>\r\n🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br>\r\n📍 Location: Parlour, NW10 5LG<br>\r\n👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/the-lord-of-the-rings-the-fellowship-of-the-ring-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0zntaxmda\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PG</a> (no children under 5 years of age)<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is NOT wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18V7kH-VvP-aDpsmfb0wSHVOlKhdjT4p6/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<span><img alt=\"🍷\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f377/32.png\">You will be asked to select whether you would like your ticket to be alcoholic or non-alcoholic in the confirm and pay section</span><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nAn epic experience is on the way, and it’s the most limited-edition event we’ve ever created. We’re embarking on <em>the</em> culinary adventure of a lifetime, and trust us, you’ll want to secure your tickets before they disappear into the fire (or someone else gets there first).<br>\r\nHere’s the deal: we’ll be screening the incredible The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring, while serving up a 7-course menu inspired by the moments you love most. From humble comfort food and warming cocktails for weary travellers, to enchanting surprises and a molten chocolate finale, every course has been crafted to bring the story to life.<br>\r\nThis is the ultimate way to revisit a cinematic classic. Journey through lands fair and foul, one delicious course at a time.<br>\r\nGather your fellow fans, whether you bring one companion or nine; adventure awaits.",
